==In Hearthstone==
{{Hearthstone-section}}
Naxxramas serves as the setting for ''[[Hearthstone (game)|Hearthstone]]''<nowiki/>'s first adventure: ''[[hswiki:Curse of Naxxramas|Curse of Naxxramas]]''. The adventure feature encounters with each of the 15 bosses from the raid's second incarnation in both Normal and Heroic mode, offering in reward 30 new Naxxramas-themed cards for use in the rest of the game, featuring ghouls, zombies, nerubians and legendary minion versions of bosses such as Kel'Thuzad, Baron Rivendare and Feugen and Stalagg.

Additionally, the Naxxramas [[hswiki:card back|card back]] was rewarded for achieving Rank 20 in Ranked Season 4, which took place during July 2014. The flavor text reads: ''"The gooey center is Ooze slime. Don’t lick it."''

